  "provider": "openrouter",
  "requestedModel": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-11T06:07:21.261673Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-03T23:18:43.970221Z",
  "totalBlocks": 61,
  "translatedBlocks": 37,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1ecd0bb835d7559",
      "translationZh": "当你基于大语言模型 (LLM) 构建应用程序时，发送给模型的提示词通常由两部分组成。一部分是用于设定上下文（指令、参考文档、对话历史）的固定部分，另一部分是包含实际用户输入的变量部分。以客户服务机器人为例，每个请求都以相同的文本块开始：“你是 AnyCompany 的支持代理。以下是我们的政策……”，随后是客户输入的任何内容。顶部的指令可能有 3,000 个 token，而底部的客户问题可能只有 50 个 token。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11d4ebd9fdb3594a",
      "translationZh": "这意味着在数百或数千次请求中，您的模型在一遍又一遍地处理相同的 3,000 个 token 的开头部分。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "179c45f7bbdf56ec",
      "translationZh": "像 vLLM 和 TensorRT-LLM 这样的 LLM 推理框架通过一种方案解决了这个问题。它们会缓存之前出现过的提示词前缀的计算结果（即键值对 KV pairs）。当新请求中出现相同的开头时，模型会复用缓存的计算结果，仅处理末尾的新 token。这被称为前缀缓存（prefix caching），它可以显著降低首 token 延迟（TTFT）。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c3ef7ca8df49272",
      "translationZh": "但在扩展到单个实例之外时会出现问题。如果你在端点后面部署了一组机器，请求会被分发到所有机器上。同一个 3,000 token 的前缀在一次请求中落在实例 A 上，下一次落在实例 B 上，再下一次落在实例 C 上。由于没有一个实例能频繁地接收到该前缀以建立可靠的缓存，每个实例都必须从头开始计算。虽然前缀缓存功能存在，但路由层将请求分发得过于分散，导致该功能无法发挥作用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e12724b681e5b8e0",
      "translationZh": "今天，Amazon SageMaker Inference 推出了前缀感知路由（prefix-aware routing）。这是一种全新的路由策略，它会查看每个请求的开头，并将具有相同开头的请求一致地发送到同一个实例。这样，该实例上的 KV 缓存（KV cache）就会不断积累并被重复使用。在我们针对 Llama 3.1 70B 进行的基准测试中，这使 P50 TTFT 降低了高达 77%，并将吞吐量提高了高达 16%。它还将 KV 缓存命中率从大约 25% 提升到了 80% 以上。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2e0ed4016ddde8fe",
      "translationZh": "前缀感知路由的作用",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c585f2bfab91ba6",
      "translationZh": "当请求到达您的端点时，Amazon SageMaker 会查看有效负载的开头，并利用它来决定应由哪个实例来处理该请求。相同的开头会发送到同一个实例。不同的开头则会分散到不同的实例中。如果 10 个请求共享一个前缀或开头，那么这 10 个请求都会发送到同一台机器，并且该机器的缓存针对该前缀保持热状态。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6737e60152bd66e0",
      "translationZh": "您无需自行标记请求或管理亲和性。端点会根据请求的内容进行处理。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ad8e3e48ec035b3b",
      "translationZh": "有两个内置的安全保障机制：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dfb8f148c67198fd",
      "translationZh": "过载保护。如果某个前缀极其热门，且目标实例已达到容量上限，端点会将请求路由到负载较低的实例。您配置并发限制，端点会遵守该限制。您可能会在那一次请求中错过缓存命中，但避免了压垮单台机器。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74e1a68c070243ef",
      "translationZh": "扩展期间的稳定行为。当您添加或移除实例时，大多数请求会继续发送到它们之前所在的同一实例。只有少量流量会转移以应对集群规模的变化。您的缓存不会在每次扩展时都被失效。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "47400bf189332ff8",
      "translationZh": "性能基准测试",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6625ebcac8de00e4",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Llama 3.1 70B Instruct 模型，在 7 个 ml.p5.48xlarge 实例上（启用 vLLM 前缀缓存功能），将前缀感知路由与默认的随机路由基线进行了基准测试。我们运行了 16 种测试配置，涵盖单模型端点、推理组件端点、原生 Invoke API 以及 OpenAI 兼容 API。所有测试均以 100% 的成功率完成。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f3b02082cf4f0d9a",
      "translationZh": "长上下文工作负载",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39497012ffea6574",
      "translationZh": "持续 1 小时的 8,000 token 共享前缀：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b98bc25300e476be",
      "translationZh": "P90 TTFT：降低了 33–37 个百分点。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "55c4d4223539026d",
      "translationZh": "P50 TTFT：降低了 71–77%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e51ebd2eca85b7af",
      "translationZh": "KV cache 命中率：从大约 25–82% 开始。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27cffe0e878110fd",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量：提升了 15–16%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "98de70366700f551",
      "translationZh": "短上下文工作负载",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7dfd6657ffc89d4",
      "translationZh": "变长 ShareGPT 风格对话，30 分钟：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aa2eac424d04e856",
      "translationZh": "P90 TTFT：降低了 24–37%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdf50213e91cce68",
      "translationZh": "P50 TTFT：降低了 13–16%。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "879edc76b049386c",
      "translationZh": "KV cache 命中率：从大约 30–80% 开始。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ec3ee978ed5cb14d",
      "translationZh": "当您创建端点配置时，可以配置前缀感知路由。有两个参数控制其行为：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ce55257c3e7107f2",
      "translationZh": "PrefixLength (1024–65536)：用于路由的请求内容长度。对于原生的 Amazon SageMaker Invoke API，这是从请求体开头计算的字节数。对于与 OpenAI 兼容的 API，这是从提取的消息文本中计算的字符数。将其设置为覆盖您的共享前缀，并包含足够的唯一内容，以便将不同的工作负载分散到各个实例中。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e722b1a2724ac001",
      "translationZh": "ConcurrencyThreshold (1–1024)：在触发溢出之前，目标实例上允许的最大在途请求数。如果目标实例达到此限制，请求将转至负载较低的实例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10b77ff34f5d0789",
      "translationZh": "然后像往常一样创建您的端点：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4f8490d63efe1da",
      "translationZh": "您的模型容器或推理框架无需进行任何更改。前缀感知路由完全在端点路由层运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e068009171436511",
      "translationZh": "调用端点",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a169c04fe9bfdfbd",
      "translationZh": "调用端点的方式没有任何变化。相同的 InvokeEndpoint 和 InvokeEndpointWithResponseStream API 的工作方式与以前完全一致：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c13fd36b1e317ef",
      "translationZh": "对于与 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completion API 也是如此：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46d9194ac474504d",
      "translationZh": "保持请求序列化的一致性。对于原生 Invoke API，PrefixLength 作用于原始字节。JSON 的空格、键的顺序和格式都会影响路由。如果你在不同请求中以不同的方式序列化相同的提示词，它们可能会被分配到不同的实例上。请使用一致的序列化方式。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe4c4e564e601ec2",
      "translationZh": "仔细设置 PrefixLength 的大小。如果设置得太短，所有具有相同短前缀的请求都会被汇集到同一个实例，从而触发溢出。如果设置得太长，微小的负载差异（例如 temperature 值）会将本应保持在一起的请求分散开。建议从共享前缀的长度加上一个适度的缓冲区开始。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a436aed1c6d75f8",
      "translationZh": "你至少需要两个实例。如果只有一个实例，无论采用何种策略，所有请求都会发送到同一个地方。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa5d78e5f159246c",
      "translationZh": "监控缓存命中率。启用 SageMaker 详细观测功能，以在模型层面跟踪 KV 缓存命中率。这可以确认前缀感知路由是否针对你的特定工作负载有效。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20d44e547ee46051",
      "translationZh": "前缀感知路由目前已在 SageMaker 实时推理端点上可用。请将您的 AWS SDK 或 CLI 更新到最新版本，以访问新的 RoutingStrategy 和 PrefixAwareRoutingConfig 参数。请参考此 notebook 以获取如何在创建端点期间启用它的示例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "google/gemma-4-26b-a4b-it:free"
    }
  ],
